From: Bariq Electronics <bariq@bariqelectronics.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 01:45:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix production image upload - enhance Supabase client
 credential handling

- Aggressively sanitize SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to remove line breaks and whitespace
- Add JWT format validation for service role key (must be 3-part JWT starting with eyJ)
- Add improved error logging in upload route to identify JWS/JWT errors
- Add production diagnostic endpoint at /api/admin/upload-diagnostic
- Enhance error messages to help identify malformed credentials

This fixes the 'JWS Protected Header is invalid' error in production by ensuring
environment variables are properly cleaned and validated before use.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
